                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "57e62956-7a4a-3934-a17d-7b4bf0c7bdb4",
                        "entry_id": "a2a658df-7cc0-315d-83e0-356df792b732",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fraught with emotion; tense."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6308452c-c241-4b12-8bfc-76f2eccf4f7f",
                                "sense_id": "57e62956-7a4a-3934-a17d-7b4bf0c7bdb4",
                                "text": "It was an emotionally charged moment when President Barack Obama addressed a joint session of the US Congress for the first time during his administration. It was also a charged moment because of failing economies in the US and around the world. Congress and the public waited to hear how he proposed to help solve the problem. President Obama suggested several strategies[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93d8786e-3e3e-499a-9681-e3984b8ae7ed",
                                "sense_id": "57e62956-7a4a-3934-a17d-7b4bf0c7bdb4",
                                "text": "Eva approached me , and her closeness made my senses come alive. There was a charged moment where words seemed superfluous. She finally broke the silence. \"So, Killian, why did you really want me here on stage? You insisted that I didn't need to audition. Was this even about the music?\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "af32ed71-76da-3101-a525-47b2c7a4a9be",
